<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!-- IsoRim Waylith - VGE Pack, model batch B8b1 (2026-10-24): rare orbital-station props, part 1. Low-poly models built
       from VGE's own textures (tools/make_vge_b8b.py, vge_b8b.mtl), under the 1.60 storey. The station antenna has VGE's two
       random looks (IsoRim picks the variant as the game picks the texture). The two station lights are IsoRim's vanilla
       emergency light model in VGE's glow colours, hung on the wall like it. Chapter 2 things are skipped quietly. -->

